en-lin-quan-pu","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004","quote":"長子銓，字公衡，美風儀，善占吐，尚武帝女永嘉公主，拜駙馬都尉。銓雖學業不及弟錫，而孝行齊焉，時人以為銓、錫二王，可謂玉昆金友。母長公主疾，銓形貌瘠貶，人不復識。及居喪，哭泣無常，因得氣疾。位侍中、丹陽尹。卒于衛尉卿。子溥，字伯淮，尚簡文帝女余姚公主。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0020","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:r0017"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"永嘉公主為梁武帝女。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAA","label":"王銓","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"銓","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0098","c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0000","c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0002","c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0031","c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0050","c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0069","c-nanshi-023-wangxi-qian:p001:m0000"]},{"surface":"公衡","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0101","c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004:m0005"]},{"surface":"王銓","mention_ids":["c-wenxiantongkao-258-yongjia-yuyao-marriages:p001:m0005"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangfen-ws2478204","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002","quote":"銓","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0098"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangfen-ws2478204","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002","quote":"公衡","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p002:m0101"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangfen-ws2478204","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003","quote":"銓","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangfen-lin-quan-pu:p004","quo